    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89961" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπλάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beat</i> or <i>knock against, touch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα δέ μιν προσπλάζον ἐρύκεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.285
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη] προσέπλαζε γενείῳ</span>”
