					Od.
					11.583
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαίης . . πεῖρας . . ἠέρι προσπλάζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					28.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
